# =========================
# Compiled objects
# =========================
# *.obj deliberately NOT ignored here - it collides with Wavefront OBJ
# mesh assets in assets/*.obj (a real bug: it silently excluded a newly
# added mesh asset from git, see docs/TECHNICAL_NOTES.md). build/ above
# already covers every actual compiler .obj output in this project.
*.o
*.lo
*.slo

